e&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6E6E73'&gt;vs benign training pkgs per value&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#86868B;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1D1D1F;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="430" width="250" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;similarity.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6E6E73'&gt;CodeBERTa embeddings (baked in)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6E6E73'&gt;k=10 distinct-family neighbours&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6E6E73'&gt;closest malware / benign file pair&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#86868B;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1D1D1F;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="430" width="250" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;b&gt;assess.py — Assessor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6E6E73'&gt;tier: malicious / suspicious / clean&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6E6E73'&gt;calibrated chance at 1% and 10% priors&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#86868B;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1D1D1F;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="560" width="250" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;llm.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6E6E73'&gt;evidence → prompt (no source code)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6E6E73'&gt;explanation + follow-up chat&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6E6E73'&gt;streams Ollama tokens&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#86868B;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1D